!include _style.iuml
@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 18
skinparam classStereotypeFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 30
hide circle
hide empty methods

top to bottom direction
title Execution values / cleanup · Processing
class "lifecycle.Claim" as Claim <<frozen execution value>> $PROC {
 job_id: UUID
 attempt_id: UUID
 lease_token: UUID
 owner_id: UUID
 source: dict
 operations: list
 source_url: str
 source_url_expires_at: datetime
 deadline_at: datetime
}
class "processing.models.CleanupIntent" as Cleanup <<cleanup ledger>> $INFRA {
 attempt_id: UUID
 job_id: UUID
 next_try_at: datetime
 tries: int
 last_error: str | None
 created_at: datetime
 retired_at: datetime | None
}
class "processing.lifecycle" as Life <<module>> $PROC {
 claim(factory, job_id, attempt_id, settings)
 live(pair, token, now)
 heartbeat(factory, work, settings)
 finish(factory, work, *, outputs, error)
}
class SubmissionGuard <<cancellation root>> $PROC {
 asset_id: UUID
 owner_id: UUID
 job_id: UUID | None
 deleted_at: datetime | None
}
note bottom of SubmissionGuard
 _guard(): create / lock; verify owner.
 Cancel before submit: tombstone without Job.
 Later submit cannot resurrect the asset.
 job_id: nullable local FK, not UNIQUE.
end note
Claim -[hidden]down- Life
Cleanup -[hidden]down- SubmissionGuard
Life ..up> Claim : claim() creates;
Life ..right> Cleanup : cleanup_intent()
note bottom of Life
  Claim is local worker authority,
  never a queue payload.
  The lease is Attempt columns, not a class.
  source_url is empty in V1; the Source
  descriptor locates the pinned object.
end note
note bottom of Cleanup
  0..1 intent per Attempt; 0..* per Job.
  job_id + attempt_id are local FKs.
  finish(error), retry, cancel and interrupt
  stage intent; recovery scans the prefix.
end note
legend bottom
  Dashed = dependency; IDs reference Job / Attempt.
  lock_pair() + live() fence heartbeat and finish.
endlegend

@enduml
